  "brand": {
    "icons": "brand-20260907",
    "wordmark": "brand-20260831",
    "admin": "admin-20260907",
    "note": "The asset folders under apps/*/public. `icons` is the badge (tab, installed app, splash, social card), `wordmark` the lettering the header and footer keep, `admin` the panel's derived set. /icons/* and /splash/* are served immutable, so new artwork needs a new folder and the old one stays on disk for links already out in the world. scripts/make-owner-brand.mjs is the ONLY writer of these three values — it rewrites them after it has generated and validated the files, so a reference can never name a folder that was not built. Consumers: apps/web manifest.ts + layout.tsx, apps/admin manifest.ts + layout.tsx."
  },
